<!-- 13 · validation and plan -->
<section class="slide v">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The plan</b></span><span>13</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Validate at Web Summit, then be profitable</div>
  <h2>Usage first, then the sale, then scale.</h2>
  <div class="tl" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)">
    <div class="ev now"><div class="d">9 TO 12 NOV 2026</div><h3>Web Summit Lisbon</h3><p>The test: do attendees use it, find it useful and pay? We publish what happens either way.</p></div>
    <div class="ev"><div class="d">THE NEXT MONTHS</div><h3>Profitable</h3><p>Sell the streams that work; customisation for people, teams and delegations first.</p></div>
    <div class="ev"><div class="d">EVERY WEEK</div><h3>The next events</h3><p>Events happen every week; most handle their data badly before, during and after.</p></div>
    <div class="ev r"><div class="d">AS IT MATURES</div><h3>Multilingual, worldwide</h3><p>Pages in more languages and cultures; publishers in Portugal and beyond as customers.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cols" style="margin-top:80px">
    <div class="card"><div class="n">IF WEB SUMMIT WORKS</div><p>Investor interest follows usage. We raise to go faster.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="n">IF IT DOES NOT</div><p>We learn in public, change the product, and try the next event. The cost to try again is low.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment case</span></div>
</section>

<!-- 14 · the investment -->
<section class="slide v ink">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The investment</b></span><span>14</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Investors and business partners wanted</div>
  <h2>Invest in an open-source company, and be part of the journey.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:70px">
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">WHAT IT IS FOR</div><h3>Development and the experience</h3><p>Building faster, the user experience, and paying the team to work on it.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">THEN</div><h3>Going to market</h3><p>Events, customisation, licensing and publishers, one stream at a time.</p></div>
    <div class="card g"><div class="n">ALSO</div><h3>Grants and partners</h3><p>Portuguese and European programmes, and business partners to run with it.</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:70px">Everything is public except the ask and the terms. <b>No figures yet: we do not have them to give honestly. We are talking to investors.</b></p>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The investment case</span></div>
